EX occupancy $= \lceil t_{EX} / 1\,\text{ns} \rceil$ cycles. One of those cycles is the normal pipeline slot, so each instruction causes $\lceil t_{EX} \rceil - 1$ stall cycles for the instruction behind it:
- $1.5, 1.7, 1.8 \to 2$ cycles $\to 1$ stall;
- $2.5, 2.8 \to 3$ cycles $\to 2$ stalls;
- $3.2 \to 4$ cycles $\to 3$ stalls;
- $< 1.0 \to 1$ cycle $\to 0$ stalls.
